{"ref":"BDB, אַדָּר","hw":"אַדָּר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַדָּר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> (<em>noble</em>?).<br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Bela, grandson of Benjm. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.3\">1 Ch 8:3</a> (perhaps error—cf. Be—for <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְדְּ</span> q.v. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:40\" href=\"/Numbers.26.40\">Nu 26:40</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:21\" href=\"/Genesis.46.21\">Gn 46:21</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  city in Judah <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:3\" href=\"/Joshua.15.3\">Jos 15:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אַדָּ֫רָה)</span>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצַר אַדָּר</span> (q.v.) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:4\" href=\"/Numbers.34.4\">Nu 34:4</a>.","next":"BDB, אַדִּיר","prev":"BDB, אֲדוֹרַ֫יִם"}